name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"171.9375\"><br></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><img data-key=\"11\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8e3b-audiofreehighqps/CE/C2/GKwRIJIMoySmAAfY8wQS2TUh.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8e3b-audiofreehighqps/CE/C2/GKwRIJIMoySmAAfY8wQS2TUh.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8e3b-audiofreehighqps/CE/C2/GKwRIJIMoySmAAfY8wQS2TUh.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"1000.1953124999999\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8e3b-audiofreehighqps/CE/C2/GKwRIJIMoySmAAfY8wQS2TUh.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"186.703125\"><br></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><img data-key=\"12\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ff88-audiofreehighqps/36/48/GAqhfD0MoySyAAXK9gQS2T98.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ff88-audiofreehighqps/36/48/GAqhfD0MoySyAAXK9gQS2T98.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ff88-audiofreehighqps/36/48/GAqhfD0MoySyAAXK9gQS2T98.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"1000.1953124999999\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ff88-audiofreehighqps/36/48/GAqhfD0MoySyAAXK9gQS2T98.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"186.703125\"><br></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><img data-key=\"13\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/5311-audiofreehighqps/B8/F0/GKwRIRwMoyS8AAWu3AQS2Udt.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" alt=\"\" data-origin=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/5311-audiofreehighqps/B8/F0/GKwRIRwMoyS8AAWu3AQS2Udt.jpg?op_type=0\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/5311-audiofreehighqps/B8/F0/GKwRIRwMoyS8AAWu3AQS2Udt.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-large-height=\"562.2796709753231\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/5311-audiofreehighqps/B8/F0/GKwRIRwMoyS8AAWu3AQS2Udt.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-preview-height=\"104.95887191539366\"><br></p><span><br></span><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>罗马依然现代而古老，梵蒂冈的大教堂屹立不倒，在许愿池旁的街道上肆意奔跑，那不勒斯的邮轮吹响了号角。西西里的味道就像是烧烤，浓郁和炸裂一样都不少。马耳他的人民，不愁温饱，融合的文化是他们独有的骄傲。</span></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>希腊不止有雅典的辉煌，克里特岛带来独有的昂扬，有海滨的明朗，有小城的古墙。古希腊有那么多帝王，留住我们的却是唇齿飘香。回望帕特农神庙透下来的光，柯林斯运河蹦极的少年郎，带着无限的回忆和憧憬，我们飞往了更西的西方。</span></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>西班牙的魅力不必思量，跟着</span><span>frank</span><span>继续游荡。巴塞罗那是建筑的天堂，千万也别错过海鲜饭的回味绵长。打开车门，点燃引擎，点燃也是旅行的光芒。不停地探索，才能发现阿利坎特这样的宝藏，到达前漫天的彩虹，让我们继续追逐着光，穿过黑暗的墙。格拉纳达，摩尔人的第二故乡。阿尔罕布拉宫，如一幕永恒的篇章，是历史上难以攻占的战场，更是统治者的温柔乡。钟爱的昆卡，在深山里散发着光芒。这里覆盖冬夜里的冰霜，也会飘出岩石缝里的暗香。穿过伊比利亚半岛，我们终于来到了马德里的大街小巷，在丽池公园穿过了鸟语花香，在西班牙皇宫驻足观望。精彩的旅程，总会有他的终章。让我们继续期待下一次启程，行走的光芒永不消亡！</span></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>期待下次路上见！</span></p><span><br></span><span><br></span>",
